{"id":"input-a446064c743e","steamAppId":"960420","name":"Hello Neighbor: Hide and Seek","imageUrl":"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/960420/131439ade801ec17bffe342b9e7c5d883d8b7a01/library_600x900.jpg","steamUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/960420/","genres":["Action","Adventure"],"platforms":["windows"],"controllerSupport":"full","playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":false,"coop":false,"localCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"onlineCoop":false,"maximumPlayers":null},"storage":{"windowsMinimumGB":2.0,"windowsMinimumDisplay":"2 GB"},"verificationStatus":"identified","supportsVietnamese":false,"vietnameseSupportStatus":"not_listed","steamTags":["Horror","Adventure","Singleplayer","First-Person","Puzzle","Stealth","Story Rich","Family Friendly","Difficult","Indie","Puzzle Platformer","3D Platformer","3D","Cartoony","Character Action Game","Colorful","Psychedelic","Emotional","Atmospheric","Logic"],"sourceProfile":{"shortDescription":"Hello Neighbor: Hide and Seek follows the tragic story of the Neighbor’s family in this dramatic prequel to Hello Neighbor. Experience playing a game of hide-and-seek with your brother as you both deal with the loss of a family member.","developers":["Dynamic Pixels"]},"content":{"status":"success","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T09:56:14.682826+00:00","identityStatus":"verified","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","shortDescription":"Hello Neighbor: Hide and Seek follows the tragic story of the Neighbor’s family in this dramatic prequel to Hello Neighbor. Experience playing a game of hide-and-seek with your brother as you both deal with the loss of a family member.","detailedDescription":"This is a prequel to Hello Neighbor\n\nHello Neighbor: Hide and Seek follows the tragic story of the Neighbor’s family in this dramatic prequel to Hello Neighbor. Experience playing a game of hide-and-seek with your brother as you both deal with the loss of a family member. The game explains events that lead up to the original Stealth Horror hit Hello Neighbor."},"vi":{"status":"translated","shortDescription":"Xin chào hàng xóm: Hãy trốn và tìm kiếm theo câu chuyện bi thảm về gia đình hàng xóm trong lời giới thiệu đầy xúc động này cho người láng giềng. Kinh nghiệm trong việc chơi trốn tìm với anh trai khi cả hai đối mặt với sự mất mát của một thành viên trong gia đình.","detailedDescription":"Đây là một tờ giới thiệu cho xin chào hàng xóm.\nXin chào hàng xóm: Hãy trốn và tìm kiếm theo câu chuyện bi thảm về gia đình hàng xóm trong lời giới thiệu đầy xúc động này cho người láng giềng. Kinh nghiệm trong việc chơi trốn tìm với anh trai khi cả hai đối mặt với sự mất mát của một thành viên trong gia đình. Trò chơi giải thích các sự kiện dẫn đến vụ tàng hình của công ty hàng xóm."}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/960420/header.jpg?t=1781539183"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/960420/93294cf2a3a0320363ed0c343a160316ee087940/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781539183"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/960420/ss_d72ed24f6b12e5a4f35620e9b1afa1448a3f44e0.600x338.jpg?t=1781539183","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/960420/ss_d72ed24f6b12e5a4f35620e9b1afa1448a3f44e0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781539183"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/960420/ss_2274c9a18619ba43762876eb8d182726c467536e.600x338.jpg?t=1781539183","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/960420/ss_2274c9a18619ba43762876eb8d182726c467536e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781539183"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/960420/ss_ab0e8a295a5b8eae24659105e10ae3d114271c81.600x338.jpg?t=1781539183","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam